{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/0/content","kr_sha":"8292e4282c99e199a78e8ab01b4d17c6bd122b083f58d58157ab5d28ce75a0c1","zh":"所謂藝術的本質，正如同破碎的鏡片上漫反射出的各種顏色一般。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/1/content","kr_sha":"c4b0d998701ce8496b381f58b3c40a22d85e6e8f1a92369cd6549402eb1d320e","zh":"不可理解，不可預測，全然無跡可循……卻如此不可思議地美麗。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/2/content","kr_sha":"6f8a697e25324c392339b57e887dd5e50fbf6941da86d21a9d321fa9b30f799c","zh":"因為任何事物都能被描畫出來，因此任何想像都可以被具象為現實……","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/3/content","kr_sha":"3a5fb2c494cd30981057e658e11b3dfb7f0d53dc4dd301ae4df2e80fd6e447d9","zh":"……即使是無法想像的事情，也能從觀看某人的作品中領悟出靈感。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/4/content","kr_sha":"3fb843ca655972b8e00ccc4ef44c20f4012dd141e7b3327201bdf46b53f3ff63","zh":"因此，選擇環指與藝術，正是我人生中最為明智的決定。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/5/content","kr_sha":"8e4d47bec40608e1bc6f30e1d521ecf4f52bcb78d9a095bd478c3c4c0a147ff3","zh":"也許我的一生自最初起就是一種藝術。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/6/content","kr_sha":"0c655d4cc51e464fe4c001bdfeaa501231f8cc529b15e9b24c53146f39342992","zh":"因為對我而言有許多令我感興趣的事物，正如漫反射所致的七色光芒一般……","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/7/content","kr_sha":"281424fe2ce90a5f09421d6b6e8115dc33ce9faeca4ac4776c65532d2b6d4a13","zh":"只是沉湎於一項技術……說到底，那種只在發布會上發表些預測範圍內的「發現」的人生，從一開始就不適合我。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/8/content","kr_sha":"cf91b866b88781064e5029eeb2b775162531df48ba91dccfd5ecafcaf231e77f","zh":"因此，受點描派相邀，也是我人生中的一大幸事。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/9/content","kr_sha":"8cac9523906ac1833eb1606c419eb2128d252eb7fa62bc61706284287ae12070","zh":"一個點包含著無限的宇宙。然後這些點逐漸增加，形成宇宙的集合。它們聚集在一起的樣子，本身又會成為另一個宇宙……","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/10/content","kr_sha":"d08b080bf83b1b3d0ab2c3080390794f48201a0cd2097609f6c27b25af76f0bc","zh":"點描派的創作僅僅是注視著便能令我永遠陷入思考，這種吸引對我來說不能不稱之為是必然的。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/11/content","kr_sha":"27421507fecd254b74b6dcf6a68898b337bf328b59b80470250b43f35fda2212","zh":"在得到環指學徒這一高尚的稱號之後，我便如同插上了人工的翅膀一般，盡情地享受著屬於我的自由和可能性。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/12/content","kr_sha":"d441af32efda2ae1f5d87e7829cf2a45555e4e4934f2dafcf741c1bbdacb7362","zh":"那真是一段愚蠢得令人發笑的日子啊。我的翅膀只需由我所親手繪製出來就好這種事，那個迷戀於把無聊的機械零件組裝在一起的、孩提時代的我，到死也不會知道吧。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/13/content","kr_sha":"caf3f57fa9caa6be526a4c0f8c44fb2fb5bdc2845265ea1567526fe1893475ef","zh":"啊……那些於愚蠢中浪費的時間，真是太可惜了。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/14/content","kr_sha":"f858292a0d74164987dc844b6afa3cf5a0aeef7d9dc9bb5e98a17450d8a55757","zh":"那些把渾渾噩噩地度過的時間當作命運的、安於現狀的日子。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/15/content","kr_sha":"0339229a200bb7b49023de2a45f0ad1e5ec22ee52c6ee226a2117b07a595f9d6","zh":"拿起筆，去親手重塑它們的樣子吧。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/16/content","kr_sha":"5ee41ad54bb0a15d70138a457c5a63b5c6caa8e526674e0fa71d22267656ca74","zh":"無用的過去就此昇華為藝術；曾被視為無價值之物一霎間被塑造為美麗。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/17/content","kr_sha":"dc729dbb76748dad73fe6ef92b90683f6a693d6a664d542dbe9e919fc3793b1f","zh":"雖然現在只是環指的一名學徒而已，但只要跟隨創作無數傑作的大師之腳步……我的作品也能日新月異地急速進步吧。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/18/content","kr_sha":"2c087f1918bd7029a810e2c97cf8d75cff995665a33500e95c78cea03b9f88fc","zh":"此刻我的心情變得更加輕鬆，可以用毫無負擔的心態去面對此次「課題評價」了。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/19/content","kr_sha":"595d72a5ce50668ba89950ae096f73d84749a7c705884c07840b50bcbccc286b","zh":"……很快我就到達了評價現場。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/20/content","kr_sha":"a0ce19eb4933dafdb858ae26a94149fbd4fa94e57423a40cb98120d0616f33c8","zh":"令人不快、意義不明的作品，以及極度的不安感所籠罩下的人們的面貌。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/21/content","kr_sha":"1dbeb012c66968caa0634559b2f00344543a84e052908bfc216b6e0d7edc22be","zh":"他們的哀求聲重疊在一起，在空間中迴響。但對我而言，這只不過是嗡嗡作響的雜音罷了。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/22/content","kr_sha":"2a3974ba700471a78adf2bb193cdfd93297f3baa2b36065b1370962c4085c845","zh":"那大概只是為了保住性命，在懇求著我給予他們得以通過的評價吧。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/23/content","kr_sha":"c9827664577ecc4d5c7f50cafd671acd28a932f257de55518714304803df984e","zh":"答案是不及格。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/24/content","kr_sha":"6ce3018698069240a4f7eade2b636c8bd43780cc60b1cb62e8431c725a551ef8","zh":"都是些乏善可陳的東西。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/25/content","kr_sha":"9ce1e359485c43aa8c497e4c05e8b8961c314c040449910ba827b9fea1a515b5","zh":"但……","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/26/content","kr_sha":"046a78ac35c1cb201b49347cf4b897055449ac2f1b31b5ae3fa13110e643be20","zh":"是啊，那並不代表著沒有答案。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/27/content","kr_sha":"df271b972da3ca6a088fb49b0ebbc4a2ca0a39120401f013f4669c1d4771ebac","zh":"我把因不安而顫抖的居民們聚集在一起，告知他們我會對他們的作品進行評價。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/28/content","kr_sha":"5a6525976ed950808cd128e76b1f326a57e0404b741fca89b987a33f47988f71","zh":"是的，對這份「團體」作品的評價。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/29/content","kr_sha":"5f080668eb8a600930cea738686b055d6d8b7d9f311bb017cc2a5498bafe6fb1","zh":"當然，他們的作品都是個人創作。但即使不成熟，只要有比他們見識更好的我的幫助……","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/30/content","kr_sha":"f493874d67c6c5e07f1b18ee1f2a221f20aa6fd0ab9d82e9baafb622af2fd873","zh":"……這份作品，一定會成為優秀的團體作品吧。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/31/content","kr_sha":"456d2396910d23ccd7f072197cf211a994c076dc50e97b7dc4dd8cd137e512da","zh":"其中的一些人露出了困惑的表情。完美的理想狀態。如果每個人都是這樣一副表情，那就……太單調了。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/32/content","kr_sha":"f48ce6456cbe851930c673c01ad770eca77cf2b2d1269713459f8f3a47570c23","zh":"而我是如此地喜悅……","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
