{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/35/content","kr_sha":"fdb91702853ee653150bed3a3d8f4b8d112583d5957465ea296cfd7a0dd62f98","zh":"充滿動搖、困惑、不安以及垂死掙扎的神態，無定形地倒在地板上的樣子。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10109.json|/dataList/36/content","kr_sha":"e174d38cecb2d13ee1ca4c3e0554dae1db97d065fbc3f88c8c994f3e4d974844","zh":"他們用這種方式準備了一份觀眾參與型團體作品，這一點令我心中充溢著激動。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
